<title>USA: El Salvador buys PL 480 tallow, passes on soymeal.</title>
<headline>El Salvador buys PL 480 tallow, passes on soymeal.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador bought 3,800 tonnes tallow under the PL-480 export program for September 25-October 10 shipment, its U.S. export agent Panalpina Inc said.</p>
<p>The tallow was acquired from Jacob Stern Co at $599.00 a tonne, FOB, out of the U.S. Gulf.</p>
<p>But it passed completely on the soybean meal tender, the agent said.</p>
<p>--Doris Frankel 312-983-7305</p>
</text>
